# fw_printenv and fw_setenv configuration
#
# Build-time default: the SD card, which is what the img/sd provision profiles
# boot from. On the DART-MX95 that is /dev/mmcblk1 (42860000.mmc); the eMMC is
# /dev/mmcblk0, the reverse of the i.MX8MP DART. The avocado-uboot-env service
# regenerates /run/avocado/fw_env.config at boot from the detected boot device,
# so an eMMC-provisioned target corrects this at runtime.
#
# Offsets match env-mmc.cfg (CONFIG_ENV_OFFSET / _REDUND) and the uboot-env
# partition in stone-imx95-var-dart.json.

# Device name	Device offset	Env. size	Flash sector size	Number of sectors
/dev/mmcblk1	0x400000	0x20000		0x200			256
/dev/mmcblk1	0x440000	0x20000		0x200			256
